\import{fnip-macros}
\meta{agent-authored}{true}
\tag{fnip}
\taxon{Example}
\title{One voltage, or three}
\date{2026-11-26}

\p{For the parameters of the [Hodgkin–Huxley system](fnip-0071),
the steady current of \ref{fnip-0076} is strictly increasing on
#{-90\le V\le 40} and changes sign. Each value attained on that
interval therefore comes from one voltage, and the value #{0} is
one of them.}

